Volto Light Theme is now optional: juizi-blocks works on any Volto 18 site and adds the theme's hooks (such as the block theme picker) only on sites that switch it on. It no longer installs or switches on Volto Light Theme or other block add-ons (kitconcept, eeacms, plonegovbr), in the backend or the frontend. Sites that relied on juizi-blocks for any of them must add them themselves.
